  clock: 4  # 4eb2
  nonce: 4eb2  # 4eb2
  message: "Done (dev c3a2f6df45). high_risk now documented: spec §'IO-boundary reporting' (existence + membership rule + semantics) + ADR-0016 §1 'Risk classification' clause + the io_boundary.py HIGH_RISK_PRIMITIVES/is_high_risk docstrings + a reciprocal taint.py cross-ref. Stated: subprocess-scoped, display-only, NOT a net/fs taxonomy (net/fs risk = taint model + dst_tier). Correction to the item's 'and schema' framing: high_risk is NOT a docs/schema.json behavior-map field — it lives in the separately-versioned io-boundaries envelope (IO_BOUNDARIES_SCHEMA_VERSION), so it is correctly documented in spec/ADR/code, not schema.json."  # 4eb2
